Package: sos-vault
Version: VERSION_PLACEHOLDER
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce, docker-compose-plugin | docker-compose-v2, ufw, openssl, sosreport, rsync, keyutils, cryptsetup, dmidecode
Maintainer: SOS-Vault Support <support@sos-vault.com>
Homepage: https://sos-vault.com
Description: SOS-Vault appliance — self-hosted sosreport ingestion and search
 SOS-Vault is a self-hosted server for sosreport ingestion, indexing,
 and search. The application code runs from container images pulled from
 the registry at install time; this package ships only the host-side
 pieces: the docker-compose stack, an interactive installer that
 provisions the vault directory / GPG keyring / TLS cert / systemd unit,
 and the privileged helper scripts required by the in-product
 CertificateManager admin page.
 .
 After dpkg -i, run /opt/sos-vault/sysadmin/installer.sh as root to
 finish setup.
